# 3. Create the Consumer Group

Run this once in Redis CLI:

```bash
docker exec -it <redis_container> redis-cli
```

Then:

```text
XGROUP CREATE vision_detections tracking_group $ MKSTREAM
```

Explanation:

| Part              | Meaning                    |
| ----------------- | -------------------------- |
| vision_detections | stream name                |
| tracking_group    | group name                 |
| $                 | start from latest messages |
| MKSTREAM          | create stream if missing   |

