# 5. Add Message Acknowledgement

We must tell Redis when processing is complete.

Modify `main.py`.

```python
for msg_id, message in reader.read():

    detections = message["detections"]

    objects = tracker.update(detections)

    event = {
        "camera_id": message["camera_id"],
        "frame_id": message["frame_id"],
        "objects": objects
    }

    publisher.publish(event)

    reader.redis.xack(
        config.INPUT_STREAM,
        "tracking_group",
        msg_id
    )

    print("Processed frame", message["frame_id"])
```

Now Redis knows:

```text
this message was successfully processed
```

